  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "こおりついた　からだは　こうてつの\nように　かたい。たちふさがる　ものを\nきょたいで　おしつぶし　いどうする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "얼어붙은 몸은 강철처럼\n단단하다. 앞을 가로막는 것을\n커다란 몸으로 파괴하며 이동한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Son immense corps recouvert de glace est aussi\nsolide que de l’acier. Quand il se déplace, il écrase\ntout qui se trouve sur son passage.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sein eisbedeckter Körper ist so hart wie Stahl.\nEs nutzt diese stahlharte Hülle, um Hindernisse\nzu zerschmettern und sich so seinen Weg zu bahnen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su cuerpo, cubierto de hielo, es tan duro como el\npropio acero. Su abultada figura le permite arramblar\ncon todo lo que se encuentra a su paso.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il suo enorme corpo di ghiaccio è duro come l’acciaio.\nAvanza distruggendo tutto ciò che gli si para davanti.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its ice-covered body is as hard as steel.\nIts cumbersome frame crushes anything that\nstands in its way.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "凍りついた　体は　鋼鉄のように\n硬い。立ちふさがる　ものを\n巨体で　押しつぶし　移動する。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su cuerpo, cubierto de hielo, es tan duro como el\npropio acero. Su abultada figura le permite arramblar\ncon todo lo que se encuentra a su paso.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "せなかに　すうひきの　カチコールを\nのせて　くらす　ようすは　まるで\nこおりの　こうくうぼかんのようだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "등에 수 마리의 꽁어름을\n태우고 지내는 모습은 마치\n얼음으로 된 항공모함 같다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quand on le voit transportant les petits Grelaçon\nqui vivent sur son dos, il y a une ressemblance\ncertaine avec les véhicules déplaçant les fusées.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mit den zahlreichen Arktip auf seinem Rücken sieht es\naus wie ein Flugzeugträger aus Eis.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Parece un portaaviones de hielo, por el aspecto que\npresenta al llevar varios Bergmite en su espalda.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ospita numerosi Bergmite sul suo dorso, come\nuna vera e propria portaerei di ghiaccio.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The way several Bergmite huddle\non its back makes it look like\nan aircraft carrier made of ice.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "背中に　数匹の　カチコールを\n乗せて　暮らす　様子は\nまるで　氷の　航空母艦のようだ。",
